<title>USA: Warnaco names three directors to board.</title>
<headline>Warnaco names three directors to board.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warnaco Group Inc said it named William Fields, Joseph Flom and Walter Loeb to its board of directors.</p>
<p>Fields is also the chairman of Viacom Inc affiliate Blockbuster Entertainment Group.  Flom is a corporate attorney and partner in the law firm of Skadden, Arps, Slate, Meagher &amp; Flom LLP.  Loeb is a retail analyst and heads a private consulting firm, Loeb Associates Inc.</p>
<p>(( -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
